OL,3,GNEWSAWe asked teens what schools should
OL,4,Ateach them about work. This is what
OL,5,Athey said
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than four in 10 UK teenagers want
OL,8,Fmore work experience opportunities at
OL,9,Fschool, with a similar proportion
OL,10,Fcalling for more guidance on how to
OL,11,Fapply for jobs, a survey for the BBC
OL,12,Fsuggests.
OL,14,FThe online survey, by Survation, asked
OL,15,F2,000 young people aged 13 to 18 about
OL,16,Fthe world of work and the help they
OL,17,Fneed to secure employment once they
OL,18,Fleave full-time education.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
