OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWe asked teens what schools should
OL,4,Ateach them about work. This is what
OL,5,Athey said
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome called for more support with their
OL,8,Fcommunications skills and raised
OL,9,Fconcerns about stress management and
OL,10,Fpersonal finances.
OL,12,FSkills Minister Jacqui Smith said it
OL,13,Fwas the government's "mission" to
OL,14,Fensure teenagers leave school
OL,15,F"confident about their next step and
OL,16,Fequipped with the skills and experience
OL,17,Fthey need to succeed".
